  "stock_about": "Lengths a design may count on, mm. M3 is the list this plugin has always named; the other sizes are the preferred lengths of ISO 4762 in the range small printed parts use. This is a starting list, not anybody's drawer: a project replaces a row with what its owner stocks. Other M3 lists were in use in one project and are superseded as defaults: 8 to 25 with 18 and 22 (the owner's own stock), 6 to 30 (a generator), one 35."
